  "2026-08-26T15:49:45.715Z","harness:codex","Final dependency evidence: ESLint resolves to 10.9.1 and @types/node to 26.3.0; runtime Node declarations retain the >=22 floor. Registry census leaves only TypeScript 7 (typesript-eslint peer incompatibility, pm-do5b) and npm-package-arg 14 (Node engine incompatibility, pm-ksr40d), now linked as causal discoveries rather than generic related edges. Audit reports zero vulnerabilities; typecheck, ESLint, zero-clone, exact coverage, static quality, package artifact, npx, bunx, and packed consumer proof pass."
